Package: ComparativeAnalysisTool
Title: Compare Conserved Regions of Regulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Minhein", "Htet", email="htetm@uchicago.edu", role=c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to help analyze and compare which genes and accompanying regulatory regions
    are structurally conserved between species from two lists of genes/regions. Regions of Regulation are expected
    to be 500 kilo base or higher to reflect potential Topologically Associating Domains.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5)
Imports: data.table, GenomicRanges, grid, ggnewscale, ggplot2, igraph, IRanges, R.utils, rappdirs, rtracklayer, stringr, shiny
Remotes:
    bioc::GenomicRanges,
    bioc::IRanges,
    bioc::rtracklayer
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
